     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dead-night-2016-11-30#:~:text=My%20penthouse%20is%20safe."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Yahenni drained a Consulate cruiser's driver to death to protect them, extending their life to twenty-two days, and Nissa comforted them as a friend.",
